WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:05.022
This is the second time I've seen a
little-faceted vehicle.

00:00:05.042 --> 00:00:07.982
This one is a present one, but it's a
vehicle of four people.

00:00:07.983 --> 00:00:09.863
And this one is the same.

00:00:10.263 --> 00:00:13.324
One, five of our people, and a third of
course.

00:00:14.524 --> 00:00:15.265
And that's a cross.

00:00:15.985 --> 00:00:19.066
We're about to discover a city that's rich
beyond measure.

00:00:19.366 --> 00:00:21.587
Those in power are obsessed with records.

00:00:21.907 --> 00:00:25.688
Everything has to be bigger, better, and
more expensive than anywhere else.

00:00:26.008 --> 00:00:30.770
Our guide shows us what he describes as a
gigantic luxurious paradise.

00:00:45.552 --> 00:00:49.534
Huge buildings go by, all marble and
grandiose architecture.

00:00:50.174 --> 00:00:53.716
The roofs of the buildings are all green
or red, the colours of the flag.

00:00:54.336 --> 00:00:56.317
Another rule imposed by the authorities.

00:01:37.572 --> 00:01:38.853
I've seen everything white.

00:01:39.413 --> 00:01:44.395
And if a collod car comes in the capital,
what happens?

00:01:44.535 --> 00:01:45.495
You can use a taxi.

00:01:45.595 --> 00:01:50.737
You can invite the friends, take a rent
car.

00:01:51.538 --> 00:01:53.058
This is the capital of our country,

00:01:53.158 --> 00:01:58.561
and we want to show as more beautiful as
possible.

00:01:59.401 --> 00:02:01.722
This strange structure is another record.

00:02:02.262 --> 00:02:06.184
This is the world's largest indoor wheel,
47 meters high.

00:02:32.597 --> 00:02:36.779
We are alone in the whole caravan, there
is only us.

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:38.720
But as far as we can see, there is no one
in the park.

00:02:38.721 --> 00:02:39.421
There is not a single human being.

00:02:39.421 --> 00:02:42.022
There is absolutely no one.

00:02:42.023 --> 00:02:44.243
That's the feeling we've had since our
arrival.

00:02:44.884 --> 00:02:49.887
Although the country officially has 7
million inhabitants, we didn't see many of

00:02:49.887 --> 00:02:51.887
them in the capital.

00:02:51.887 --> 00:02:55.470
From above, we could see huge gardens, but
not a living soul for miles around.

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:58.772
There was a weird feeling of being in a
ghost town.

